        {
          "ID": "Start",
          "Text": "Hollin Vesk does not look up from a survey map until she has finished the line she is tracing. 'You are not Recension. Good. I am a Searcher, which the Mainline tolerates the way it tolerates weather. Ask, or don't.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "What does a Searcher search for?",
              "Target": "Library",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Text": "You said you had work for an outsider.",
              "Target": "Contract",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "accept"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Text": "Here is the Stillleaf register.",
              "Target": "Delivered",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "deliver"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "deliver"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "About Stillleaf: I must tell you what I did.",
              "Target": "Reported",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "report"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "report"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "I am done searching. Release me from it.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "release"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "release"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "Farewell.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Library",
          "Text": "'The Sealed Libraries. The Reader un-remembered them so that no one could make the Recension open them, and the Recension keeps that bargain. I keep catalogue fragments instead: three shelf-marks from a place called Stillleaf, copied by a hand that is dead. The Mainline cannot look for it without breaking faith. An outsider can, at no cost to anyone but the outsider.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Then tell me the work.",
              "Target": "Contract",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "accept"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Text": "Back.",
              "Target": "Start",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Text": "Farewell.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Contract",
          "Text": "'Stillleaf's last keeper was preserved at the Salt-Vault, six chunks south and one east of here. Pale Curation files its dead by their last words, and I have the keeper's. Say them to an Indexer and the file opens; the keeper's key should be filed beside the body. Curation will ask something for it. Hear them out; I make no promises on their behalf. Bring the register to light. That is the whole of what I ask, and I will pay you in standing with people who keep grudges for centuries.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "I will carry the words.",
              "Target": "Accepted",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "accept"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "accept"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "Not now.",
              "Target": "Start",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Text": "Farewell.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Accepted",
          "Text": "She writes the words on a slip and hands it over. 'Keeping is not the same as showing. Those are the keeper's, not mine. South and east to the Salt-Vault; the Indexers are the ones with the ledgers. When you have the register, I am here.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Understood.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Delivered",
          "Text": "Hollin takes the register in both hands and does not open it. 'Sealed within the hour; the Mainline will see to that, and I will let them. But it is real, and it is here, and no one will have to search for it again.' She enters your name in a table that is not an attribution list.",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Understood.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Reported",
          "Text": "Hollin writes it down exactly as you say it, then reads it back to be sure. 'Entered as told, not as confirmed. Thank you for telling me yourself.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Farewell.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ID": "StillleafIndexer_1",
      "Nodes": [
        {
          "ID": "Start",
          "Text": "Teodra Halm does not look up. 'Intake or retrieval? The Salt-Vault does not receive social calls, and I am not the window for either.' A gloved hand rests on a ledger whose every line ends the same way.",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "I am looking for a keeper's file.",
              "Target": "Index",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Text": "I have the keeper's last words. Keeping is not the same as showing.",
              "Target": "File",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "retrieve"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "retrieve"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "About the request you made for the key.",
              "Target": "Request",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "agree"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Text": "Here is the Stillleaf register, to be filed.",
              "Target": "Filed",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "file"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "file"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "About Stillleaf: I must tell you what I did.",
              "Target": "Noted",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "report"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "report"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "Farewell.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Index",
          "Text": "'Then you have nothing. We file the preserved by their last words: the final sentence, entered exactly, argued over for a week if need be. A name is not an index. A place is not an index. Bring me the words and I will find the file; bring me anything else and I will file you under: visitors, unproductive.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Back.",
              "Target": "Start",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Text": "Farewell.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "File",
          "Text": "The gloved hand closes the ledger on the entry. 'Keeper, Stillleaf; salt-cured; effects: one iron key, filed beside. Status: continuing. The key is Curation's to release, and the Curation has a request. Not a toll. A request.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Name it.",
              "Target": "Request",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            },
            {
              "Text": "Farewell.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Request",
          "Text": "'If you open Stillleaf, bring what you find here, to be filed, not read. The keeper is a vessel we hold; the register is paper, and paper is lossy, and it belongs beside the body it describes. Agree, and the file is released. Refuse, and it stays with its keeper, which is also correct.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Agreed. I will bring it here to be filed.",
              "Target": "Released",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "agree"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "agree"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "I will bring it here. I do not promise it stays.",
              "Target": "Released",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "bargain"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "bargain"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "No. I will not promise that.",
              "Target": "Refused",
              "Predicates": [
                {
                  "Key": "IfStillleafArchiveCan",
                  "Value": "refuse"
                }
              ],
              "Actions": [
                {
                  "Key": "StillleafArchive",
                  "Value": "refuse"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Text": "Farewell.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Released",
          "Text": "'Entered.' The Indexer unlocks the salt file beside the desk without rising and returns to the ledger. 'Take the key yourself. I do not hand things; I file them.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Understood.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Refused",
          "Text": "'A clean no files clean. The key stays with its keeper; the words will still open the file if you return.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Understood.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Filed",
          "Text": "The Indexer takes the register by its spine, unopened, and slides it into the salt file beside the keeper's line. The drawer locks. 'Entered: filed, unread. Status: continuing.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Understood.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ID": "Noted",
          "Text": "The gloved hand writes without hurry. 'Entered as stated. The file does not editorialise; that is what margins are for, and Curation does not keep margins.'",
          "AllowEscape": true,
          "Choices": [
            {
              "Text": "Farewell.",
              "Target": "End",
              "Predicates": [],
              "Actions": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
